# What ../../install.sh copies when someone installs this plugin without the plugin system.
# Verbs are documented in ../adversarial-review/install.manifest.

name   Greenlight
about  Merges the default branch in, pushes, starts every required check that did not run, and fixes the code until all required checks pass on the final commit.

file   skills/greenlight/SKILL.md  skills/greenlight/SKILL.md       /greenlight

tip  /greenlight   merge the default branch in, push, run every required check until all pass
